        <mxCell id="n52" value="&lt;b&gt;起 input/output socket 线程，进入 busy loop&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#8a6d3b&quot;&gt;EngineCore 主线程只做调度；收包/发包各一条线程&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;vllm/v1/engine/core.py:1111-1130 · run_busy_loop:1465&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=5;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
