        <mxCell id="n33" value="&lt;b&gt;LwdTopology.from_file → validate_layout() → 算 digest&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#8a6d3b&quot;&gt;digest = sha256(canonical json) 前 16 hex；三端必须一模一样，否则日志对不上&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;vllm/config/lwd/topology.py:330-368&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=5;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
