        <mxCell id="n15" value="`scheduler.schedule()` → SchedulerOutput&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#8a6d3b&quot;&gt;决定这一步跑哪些请求、各多少 token；**顺带在 KV 块池里分配块**&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;core.py:589-620 · vllm/v1/core/sched/scheduler.py&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=5;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="116" width="620" height="57" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="n16" value="`kv_cache_manager.allocate_slots(...)`&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#8a6d3b&quot;&gt;新请求 first-fit 连续块；已有请求 append；前缀命中复用块&lt;/font&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size:9px&quot; color=&quot;#666666&quot;&gt;vllm/v1/core/kv_cache_manager.py:402&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;spacingLeft=7;spacingRight=5;fontSize=11;fillColor=#ffffff;strokeColor=#b3b3b3;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="700" y="203" width="620" height="57" as="geometry" />
